,"text":"だって私、カナヅチだもんっ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泳げませ～～んっ!あ、でもぉ…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸次くんが教えてくれるんだったらぁ～、泳げそうな気も…たぶん、うふふっ♪"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"157423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bcd46b8d49d3aedbd3e79ab59c81737bc32b71a51cb9d6f518de6f91ba5278ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a57eb39ef5ebd9bbf79c56a6eefd903c1ec5fbbae752b50f48343999f98de320.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞森柚子","creatorId":"egs:creator:36244","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:36244","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:36244","name":"瑞森柚子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224236:157423:25171:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"このえ ゆずこ","creatorId":"vndb:s995","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s995","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s995","name":"このえ ゆずこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:50748","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25864","characterName":"姫路 麗華","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"157424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224236"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5123"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25864"},"originalCharacterName":"姫路 麗華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆様、はじめまして。私、蘭香学園の生徒会長“姫路麗華”と申します。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"水泳の話でしょうか?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はい。もともと両親が水泳選手だったため、幼少の頃から泳ぎを習わされていました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも私は別に、人生を水泳に捧げるつもりはありません。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"は?　得意な泳ぎ?　何でも得意です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛び込んだままの潜水で、50メートル行き着くことだって出来ます。"},{"spoiler":false,